in the store where you don't belong

00:01:02.659 --> 00:01:05.210
and you know you're
trying to buy something

00:01:05.210 --> 00:01:06.590
and like, you don't belong here.

00:01:06.590 --> 00:01:07.423
Like,

00:01:07.423 --> 00:01:08.710
(laughs)

00:01:08.710 --> 00:01:09.543
That's amazing.

