it's right where that house is,

00:05:17.300 --> 00:05:18.140
okay.

00:05:18.140 --> 00:05:19.477
We pull up on the street, okay.

00:05:19.477 --> 00:05:22.120
And the house is like, right there.

00:05:22.120 --> 00:05:25.603
So you're not as agile at 25

00:05:25.603 --> 00:05:29.990
