00:05:29.990 --> 00:05:31.063
And then it's all,

00:05:31.063 --> 00:05:31.896
(squealing)

00:05:31.896 --> 00:05:33.290
ow my hair, and then the horn's beeping,

00:05:33.290 --> 00:05:34.593
