00:05:37.907 --> 00:05:38.990
"What's going on out here?"

00:05:38.990 --> 00:05:41.240
Nothing, nothing, excuse me!

00:05:41.240 --> 00:05:44.600
So the second encounter
was not as successful

00:05:44.600 --> 00:05:45.970
