00:05:45.970 --> 00:05:48.730
but we had a lot of
laughs, it was pretty fun.

00:05:48.730 --> 00:05:50.740
- That's pretty much how
marriage goes though, right?

00:05:50.740 --> 00:05:51.573
The second encounter's--

00:05:51.573 --> 00:05:52.425
